     ============================================================ -->
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PROTOTYPE: Free text B — working beside answer inputs</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[
<p>Find the stationary point of \(f(x) = {@f@}\), and decide whether it is a minimum or a maximum.</p>
<p>Use the box for your working. Your working is not marked: compare it with the model working after you submit. Enter your answers in the boxes below it.</p>
<div class="free-text-container">
[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]
[[ascii input="ans1"]]
[[/ascii]]
</div>
<div>[[hint title="How to type your working"]][[commonstring key="free_text_fact"/]][[/hint]]</div>
<div>The stationary point is at \(x =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>
<div>[[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<div>where \(f(x) =\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</div>
<div>[[feedback:prt3]]</div>
<div>It is [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]</div>
